        "description": "Members will be upgraded upon meeting the required deposit or valid turnover for VIP advancement and will receive the corresponding level bonus. If multiple VIP level requirements are met at the same time, bonuses for all achieved levels will be granted. Bonuses can be claimed immediately upon upgrade and remain valid permanently."
